WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Most people think the resume is the problem.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:19.500
The truth is the first 6 seconds decide everything.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.500
I failed 40 interviews before I learned this lesson.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.500
Here's the thing nobody tells you about the H1B job search.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:49.500
You need a framework, not more applications.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:59.500
What I learned at Walmart is that data beats opinions.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:09.500
So why do we keep guessing?

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:19.500
The biggest mistake is applying to 200 jobs in a week.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:29.500
Instead pick 7 companies and go deep on each one.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:39.500
Let me tell you the story of my first product offer.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:49.500
It came from a referral, not a job board.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:59.500
Which one are you doing right now?

